# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Poltergeist
---
The moor's ghosts stopped being shy.

They rattled and knocked and pressed close, and the church bell rang though there was no rope and no bell.

'The past never stays buried,' said the coil, 'if you keep digging.' I put down my spade at once.
